    "In Season 1 of *Dexter*, there isn't one single \"Doctor\" character, but there are two primary medical professionals:\n\n1.  **Dr. Marin Rodriguez:** Played by **Ana Ortiz**. She is the medical examiner who works with the Miami Metro Police Department.\n2.  **Dr. Rudy Cooper (The Ice Truck Killer):** Played by **Christian Camargo**. While he is the primary antagonist of the first season, he poses as a doctor/medical professional to get closer to Debra.\n\nIf you are thinking of the forensic side of the show, **Dexter Morgan** (played by **Michael C. Hall**) is a blood spatter analyst, though he is not a medical doctor.",
